WEBVTT

00:06:27.758 --> 00:06:30.719
to the marginalized communities
and people in the Global South,

00:06:30.719 --> 00:06:34.807
who frankly don’t have time to get stuck
in the cycles of doom and gloom.

00:06:36.058 --> 00:06:38.769
The need for climate optimism
has never been more urgent.

00:06:38.853 --> 00:06:43.399
If we limit our vision of the future
to one filled with oil rigs,

00:06:43.399 --> 00:06:44.400
smokestacks

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.401
and suffering,

00:06:45.401 --> 00:06:46.735
we limit our capacity

00:06:46.735 --> 00:06:49.989
and shirk our duty to change
the course of humanity for the better.

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:53.409
By looking for good
and working towards the good,

00:06:53.409 --> 00:06:55.995
we empower ourselves to be agents of good

00:06:55.995 --> 00:06:58.080
in the fight for the future
that we deserve.

00:06:58.664 --> 00:06:59.748
The alternative --

00:06:59.748 --> 00:07:01.375
giving up hope --